      "standardized_narrative": "The Syndicate's opening gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2022 were GBP 1,041.0m. Analysis of the gross claims development triangle indicates a net adverse prior-year development of approximately GBP 32.6m (c.3.13% of opening reserves), driven by adverse development in certain older underwriting years partially offset by releases elsewhere. Management notes a $28m reduction in net reserve margins following the actuarial review (reflecting reduced uncertainty), holds an additional $12m margin for inflation, and completed a Group Loss Portfolio Transfer covering 2019 and prior which provides substantial adverse development reinsuring protection.",
